         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Us and Them\n\nWe can give names to our fingers. But to write a name, we first need to speak it.\n\nThe voice is very old. It did not appear with us.\n\nIn this lesson, we will see the difference between our voice and the voice of other animals.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
