         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### I Also Have a Voice\n\nWe are not the only animals that have a voice. (Yes, we are animals too, and we will see this later.)\n\nAnimals that look like us also have a voice. For example, the chimpanzee in the picture.\n\nAnimals that do not look like us also have a voice. For example, the cats that live with us.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown/html/text",
