         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Same, but Different\n\nMany animals have a voice. But as far as we know, only humans speak with different sounds.\n\nThis lets us give names to our fingers and to ourselves. Giving names is not the only thing we can do with speech.\n\nSpeech also lets us share knowledge with other people.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
