         "smile": "party",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this lesson, we learned that we are not the only animals that have a voice. We also saw the difference between our voice and the voice of other animals.\n\nWe are still in the first lessons, so we did not study the reasons why we have a type of speech that other animals do not have. We will learn this as our knowledge grows.",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
